#wanikani_api

Changed wanikani_api: https://github.com/Kaniwani/wanikani_api/pull/669
    To support kana-only vocabulary

src/genanki is my fork of kerrickstaley/genanki.
    Only change as of 2026-03-30 is using cached_properties from functools.

data/kanji.json - https://github.com/davidluzgouveia/kanji-data

Some radicals created to be same as kanji because WK does not have way to
use kanji as component for other kanji.  This fake radical then used as
component for other kanji. Ex. 売 sell -> 読 read

DONE: Add Genki lesson number, KKLC entry number, KKLD v2 entry number

