python -X utf8 generate_deck.py

    145 kanji in Genki 1.

radical
    amalgamation_subject_ids - numeric ids for the kanji that have the radical

kanji
    amalgamation_subject_ids - numeric ids for the vocabulary that have the kanji
    component_subject_ids - numeric ids for the radicals that make up this kanji

vocab
    component_subject_ids - numeric ids for the kanji that make up this vocab

